<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name><![CDATA[MOS Birder's Guide Locations]]></name>
    <description><![CDATA[A map of the Maryland Ornithological Society's Birder's Guide locations. <br><br>https://birdersguidemddc.org/<br><br>Notes:<br><br>Multiple people have contributed to the Birder's Guide over the years, which means the articles and locations can be inconsistent. Some articles cover more than one location. I've tried to separate these intro multiple points on the map. Occasionally, one location, or a similar location, will have duplicate articles.<br><br>Also, some counties are more complete than others in the Birder's Guide. For example, there are many locations along the C&O Canal in Allegany and Frederick counties, but none in Washington County.<br><br>Special Icons:<br>Car = Birding from a public road<br>Boat = Birding from a boat ramp or marina<br>Sailboat = Island inaccessible from land<br>? = Location closed indefinitely<br><br>Regions and counties:<br>These regions are consistent with those in the Birder's Guide, with the exception of DC, which is not included in this map. Counties are color coded.<br><br>Western Maryland:<br>Garrett County<br>Allegany County<br>Washington County<br>Frederick County<br><br>Central Maryland:<br>Montgomery County<br>Howard County<br>Carroll County<br>Baltimore County<br>Baltimore City<br>Harford County<br>Cecil County<br><br>Eastern Shore (Delmarva):<br>Kent County<br>Queen Anne's County<br>Caroline County<br>Talbot County<br>Dorchester County<br>Wicomico County<br>Somerset County<br>Worcester County<br><br>Southern Maryland:<br>Anne Arundel County<br>Prince George's County<br>Charles County<br>Calvert County<br>St. Mary's County]]></description>
